crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Automatic adapts to the network as you play. Press to type a fixed rate, up to 2 Gbps.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Automatic picks the best hardware decoder for this GPU, then software.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Bit-exact PCM instead of Opus — 2.3 Mb/s at 48 kHz, 4.6 at 96, off the top of the link. The host has its own switch and stays on Opus if it can't deliver the rate; the stats overlay names what the session got. Stereo only.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Capture a wired DualSense directly (touchpad, motion, adaptive triggers). Needs the USB grant when the pad is plugged in.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Capture system shortcuts
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Capture the Steam Controller 2 directly (touchpads, gyro, paddles) instead of the generic pad Android shows. Needs the Bluetooth or USB grant.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Controller haptics
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Controller rumble
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Controller speaker
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Controller type
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Controller-optimized UI
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Crop to fill
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Disconnect after
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Draws the animated backdrop small and steps it slower, so the console stays smooth on this TV's graphics chip. Nothing about a stream changes — this is the interface only.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Draws the menus at 1080p — the backdrop cheaper, too — and lets the display scale them up. Text goes a little softer; the console gets much smoother on a 4K TV or projector, whose graphics chip is far slower than the panel in front of it. Nothing about a stream changes — this is the interface only.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	DualSense over USB
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Echo cancellation
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Ends a backgrounded session so it can't run down the battery.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Ends a session left in the background after this long.
