crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Frames held back before showing. Each one absorbs about a refresh of network hiccup and adds a refresh of delay. Automatic holds two.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Freezes the backdrop and replaces the console's slides and pops with plain fades. Also the gentler choice on an OLED, where a still field can sit for hours.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Front the app with this console instead of the cursor UI. Off returns to the cursor UI immediately — switch it back on there.
