crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Higher is sharper and needs a faster wired link.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Hold OK to send a right click, for a remote with no second button. Off, OK stays the plain immediate left click.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Hold Select for guide
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	Hold Select on its own to press the host's guide button — keep holding for the host's quick-access menu. Automatic arms it only where the real button can't reach the host. A Select tap still goes through, slightly delayed.
