crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	How a physical mouse drives the host: Capture locks the pointer (relative, for games), Desktop leaves it free and sends absolute positions.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	How a physical mouse drives the host: Capture locks the pointer (relative, for games), Desktop leaves it free and sends absolute positions. Ctrl+Alt+Shift+M switches live while streaming.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	How much the overlay shows: Compact (one line) → Normal → Detailed.
crates/client/pf-console-ui/src/screens/settings/rows.rs	How much the overlay shows: Compact (one line) → Normal → Detailed. Ctrl+Alt+Shift+S cycles it live while streaming.
